<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod rises 4.7 pct yr/yr in April.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod rises 4.7 pct yr/yr in April.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production rose 0.3 percent in April, compared with March, and rose by 4.7 percent compared with April 1996, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					 Apr 97	Mar 97     Apr 96</p>
<p>General Index			104.6	 104.4	99.9</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	   +4.7	  +0.6</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	   +0.3	  -0.6</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	     +1.7	  +1.3</p>
<p>Base Year = 1990</p>
<p>Mining index			  90.0	  100.3	97.4</p>
<p>Manufacturing industry	   106.2	  104.6	98.0</p>
<p>Electricity, gas		   100.7	  104.0     108.7</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
